# Forms — Advanced

Enable when rule level includes `advanced`.

- Multi-step / wizard forms: preserve values, per-step validation, clear progress
- Dependent fields (show/hide/enable from other values) stay inside the shared form system
- Async field validation (e.g. username taken) with pending/error/success states matching tokens
- File upload: progress, retry, multiple files if concept needs it — still shared upload chrome
- Sticky form actions on long pages when UX requires; do not break mobile tap targets
- Prefer composable field primitives over page-specific form forks
